Subject: [PATCH 1/4] refspec: treat 'fetch' as a Boolean value
Message-ID: <7e662acb5ac50b778917cbf2f9f791d35e95e31d.1742250259.git.me@ttaylorr.com>
References: <xmqq5xkdrrhs.fsf@gitster.g>
 <cover.1742250259.git.me@ttaylorr.com>
